<!--
    Back: an outlined triangle with rounded corners, pointing the way out.

    The user's own choice of mark, twice adjusted to their eye: taller than it
    is wide (4.4 to 19.6 against 6.6 to 16.9), and grey rather than the
    near-white the other glyphs wear — this one is furniture, not content.
    Drawn as one closed stroke with the corners cut by quadratics; sharp
    vertices would read as a rewind button.
-->
